Column name: batch Type: TEXT Description: MSK Sample ID
Column name: donor_id Type: TEXT Description: Free-text identifier that distinguishes the unique individual that data were derived from
Column name: HTAN_Biospecimen_ID Type: TEXT Description: HTAN ID associated with a biosample based on HTAN ID SOP (eg HTANx_yyy_zzz)
Column name: treatment Type: TEXT Description: The type of treatment recieved by the patient
Column name: HTAN_Participant_ID Type: TEXT Description: HTAN ID associated with a patient based on HTAN ID SOP (eg HTANx_yyy )
Column name: procedure Type: TEXT Description: The method used in obtaining the tumor specimen, biopsy or resection
